From 9721d6b04f131585a73fe50b89017295ca71c598 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Priyadharshini Gowthaman <pgowtham@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 22:41:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] UPSTREAM:PROTOCOL:sigma_dut: Fix PreviousTK/PreviousPMK
 hostapd_cli argc mismatch

cmd_ap_get_parameter() handles "parameter,PreviousTK" and
"parameter,PreviousPMK" by shelling out to hostapd_cli's
get_previous_tk and get_previous_pmk commands and reading their
output back from a temp file:

  hostapd_cli -i <ifname> get_previous_tk <STA_MAC_Address> -0 > /tmp/previous_tk
  hostapd_cli -i <ifname> get_previous_pmk <STA_MAC_Address> -0 > /tmp/previous_pmk

Both calls pass a trailing "-0" after the MAC address, carried over
from the older "dump_tk" command (hostapd_cli_cmd_dump_tk(), which
legitimately takes two arguments: STA address and key index). However
hostapd_cli_cmd_get_previous_tk() and hostapd_cli_cmd_get_previous_pmk()
(hostapd_cli.c) are single-argument commands that explicitly check
"if (argc != 1)" and reject anything else, printing "Invalid
GET_PREVIOUS_TK/GET_PREVIOUS_PMK command: needs one argument" instead
of issuing the ctrl_iface request. Because of the stray "-0",
hostapd_cli never sends GET_PREVIOUS_TK/GET_PREVIOUS_PMK to hostapd at
all; its own usage error is redirected into /tmp/previous_tk or
/tmp/previous_pmk and returned to the CAPI caller in place of the key
material, so "parameter,PreviousPMK" (added by
189-UPSTREAM-Sigma-Dut-Get-Previous-PMK.patch) and "parameter,PreviousTK"
never actually fetch anything.

Fix both run_system_wrapper() calls in cmd_ap_get_parameter() by
dropping the trailing " -0", matching the single-argument signature
hostapd_cli_cmd_get_previous_tk()/hostapd_cli_cmd_get_previous_pmk()
actually expect.

Patch-dependency: 189-UPSTREAM-Sigma-Dut-Get-Previous-PMK.patch

Signed-off-by: Priyadharshini Gowthaman <pgowtham@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 ap.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ap.c b/ap.c
index cdf73ef..fceac81 100644
--- a/ap.c
+++ b/ap.c
@@ -19504,7 +19504,7 @@ static enum sigma_cmd_result cmd_ap_get_parameter(struct sigma_dut *dut,
 		if (!var)
 			return INVALID_SEND_STATUS;
 		run_system_wrapper(dut,
-				   "hostapd_cli -i %s get_previous_tk %s -0 > /tmp/previous_tk",
+				   "hostapd_cli -i %s get_previous_tk %s > /tmp/previous_tk",
 				   ifname, var);
 		fp = fopen("/tmp/previous_tk", "r");
 		if (!fp) {
@@ -19551,7 +19551,7 @@ static enum sigma_cmd_result cmd_ap_get_parameter(struct sigma_dut *dut,
 		if (!var)
 			return INVALID_SEND_STATUS;
 		run_system_wrapper(dut,
-				   "hostapd_cli -i %s get_previous_pmk %s -0 > /tmp/previous_pmk",
+				   "hostapd_cli -i %s get_previous_pmk %s > /tmp/previous_pmk",
 				   ifname, var);
 		fp = fopen("/tmp/previous_pmk", "r");
 		if (!fp) {
-- 
